" >Use 2 manual weapons that you control directly and 2 automatic weapons that support your build in different ways. Some automatic weapons fire constantly, while others activate during reload windows, turning timing, weapon management, and positioning into core parts of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock perks, collect items, and create powerful synergies. In The Last Leukocyte: Immune Protocol, every mechanic is meant to matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630190/extras/80d8a9358f17b1a647df51569dbb793d.poster.avif?t=1777315357\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630190/extras/80d8a9358f17b1a647df51569dbb793d.webm?t=1777315357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630190/extras/80d8a9358f17b1a647df51569dbb793d.mp4?t=1777315357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt to a living battlefield.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a growing biological threat and shape your build against an ecosystem full of enemies with different roles and behaviors.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ different enemies, each fulfilling its own role</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive escalating encounters, grow stronger during each run, and push back against an ecosystem that evolves in response to your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630190/extras/8b97c4e30c